WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:31.840 --> 01:33.180
Die!

01:38.720 --> 01:40.870
Haru!

01:47.270 --> 01:48.770
Are you okay, Elie?

01:52.210 --> 01:53.200
Haru!

01:54.610 --> 01:56.700
Beast Sword!

01:57.400 --> 01:58.910
Fool! Don't go in!

02:04.830 --> 02:06.960
The illusion disappeared?

02:10.880 --> 02:13.460
Every time you swing that sword, those beasts appear...

02:14.130 --> 02:16.760
I heard this from the one who made your sword!

02:17.760 --> 02:20.840
If you don't swing it all the way down,
that illusion won't appear!

02:21.760 --> 02:24.010
Musica The Blacksmith, huh?

02:24.600 --> 02:27.640
So, if I stop your sword from going down...

02:29.060 --> 02:30.270
You can't use your trick!

02:34.320 --> 02:37.070
You have studied me quite well.

02:38.000 --> 02:42.620
However, do you really know everything about my sword?

02:47.450 --> 02:49.120
Wha-what's happening?

02:49.290 --> 02:51.290
He didn't swing the sword, but the illusion still appeared!

02:53.670 --> 02:55.630
This is just the beginning.

02:55.670 --> 02:58.970
Rave Master, I will kill you for sure!

03:11.990 --> 03:17.440
Confrontation of Musica's two swords!

03:31.710 --> 03:34.000
Wow! Beasts!

03:34.790 --> 03:36.920
It's rather a dragon.

03:37.340 --> 03:38.510
What the hell is that?

03:38.590 --> 03:41.510
The illusion appeared without you swinging the sword
down completely?!
He didn't tell me about that.

03:42.130 --> 03:47.430
Of course. If I don't swing the sword down completely, the illusion won't appear...

03:49.640 --> 03:51.020
Until now.

04:12.240 --> 04:13.520
Haru.

04:14.870 --> 04:18.550
The Ten Commandments is my best sword ever.

04:20.670 --> 04:24.260
It shouldn't lose to Lance's Beast Sword.

04:31.850 --> 04:32.350
Hey!

04:36.810 --> 04:40.150
It's been fifteen years, Musica!

04:42.610 --> 04:46.360
It was so hard to find you.

04:46.820 --> 04:50.370
What? What do you want from me?

04:50.950 --> 04:54.830
Do you know why I only spared you that time?

05:06.180 --> 05:09.300
Because you can be useful to me.

05:09.640 --> 05:13.600
I want you to make a little modification to my Beast Sword.

05:15.850 --> 05:18.610
Is that Dark Bring?

05:18.860 --> 05:19.940
That's right.

05:20.070 --> 05:25.780
I was promoted to General of the
17th Military of Demon Card.

05:25.900 --> 05:28.700
I received Dark Bring as my reward.

05:30.870 --> 05:36.000
Idiot. I don't have the skill to do tricks
like that on swords anymore.

05:36.330 --> 05:39.790
I haven't touched a sword

05:39.830 --> 05:42.730
since I gave you that Beast Sword.

05:44.170 --> 05:46.170
So, the rumors were true...

05:48.470 --> 05:49.970
You should give up.

05:51.050 --> 05:52.310
That's fine.

05:52.560 --> 05:57.480
There are lots of blacksmiths in Punk Street.

06:00.060 --> 06:01.520
Dark Bring...

06:01.690 --> 06:05.070
Lance might have asked another blacksmith to...

06:05.400 --> 06:07.780
Oh no! Shit!

06:07.950 --> 06:10.780
I forgot to tell Haru the most important thing.

06:11.410 --> 06:12.710
Haru!

06:23.460 --> 06:25.210
That illusion is meant to blind you.

06:25.460 --> 06:27.800
His sword is going to come from nowhere! So be careful!

06:28.300 --> 06:29.800
Ok! Gotcha!

06:35.810 --> 06:37.390
It's not an illusion?!

06:48.780 --> 06:51.610
That beast just bit me.

06:52.620 --> 06:54.120
I thought it was just an illusion?!

06:55.450 --> 06:56.820
Haru! On your right!

07:13.470 --> 07:18.890
What's wrong? Is that all? Is that the Rave Master's real strength?

07:20.600 --> 07:22.260
What power and speed he has!

07:23.020 --> 07:27.980
This is not only the power of his Beast
Sword, but also of his swordsmanship!

07:34.570 --> 07:35.950
Dark Bring?!

07:48.710 --> 07:49.260
Shit!

07:50.590 --> 07:51.970
Ouch!

07:53.890 --> 07:55.680
No! Not again!

07:55.720 --> 07:58.970
Hey, Haru! This is not time to be
playing around with the dogs.

08:18.450 --> 08:22.660
No! If you keep your distance, the
illusion will come and attack you!

08:22.700 --> 08:23.830
I said...

08:23.960 --> 08:26.960
You don't have time to play around with those dogs!

08:33.550 --> 08:35.510
These aren't illusions!

08:35.840 --> 08:36.720
So, in that case...

08:49.900 --> 08:51.900
Explosion!

08:59.120 --> 09:00.450
They exploded!

09:04.040 --> 09:05.000
There it is!

09:13.300 --> 09:14.590
That's not it.

09:14.720 --> 09:16.760
The sword looks different from before.

09:20.110 --> 09:20.910
He-he.

09:21.260 --> 09:22.930
I already knew that.

09:24.980 --> 09:27.810
That's the famous sword that changes it's form.

09:28.150 --> 09:29.780
The Ten Commandments...

09:29.810 --> 09:32.110
Rave's... Rave's power?!

09:33.490 --> 09:35.280
The battle has just begun.

09:46.500 --> 09:49.040
Great! Rave Master!

09:49.790 --> 09:52.880
It wasn't fun without this!

09:55.130 --> 09:58.590
Your Rave...

10:00.220 --> 10:04.720
versus my Dark Bring, the real moment... Which will win?

10:05.890 --> 10:08.900
I will settle this!

10:16.190 --> 10:17.700
Take this, you monster!

10:19.160 --> 10:20.570
It's an illusion?

10:21.160 --> 10:22.540
Haru, behind you!

10:22.990 --> 10:24.830
I know. I see him!

10:30.580 --> 10:33.170
That was an illusion too?!

10:53.310 --> 10:54.980
Haru!

11:19.880 --> 11:21.220
Oh, Haru's shirt...

11:21.260 --> 11:26.310
Oh my. Cattleya, as usual, you have too much strength.

11:26.350 --> 11:27.640
That's not it.

11:27.890 --> 11:30.730
Then, Cattleya is Hercules, right?

11:30.940 --> 11:32.310
Isn't that the same thing?

11:33.440 --> 11:37.440
Anyway, it's strange that it tore.
The shirt wasn't worn out at all...

11:39.580 --> 11:40.560
Possibly...

11:40.790 --> 11:41.730
Possibly?

11:42.530 --> 11:46.870
Cattleya's arm strength has been
abnormally developed, maybe...

11:48.700 --> 11:51.670
Do you really want me to tear this petal off?

11:52.670 --> 11:54.290
What a shameless deed!

11:54.960 --> 11:56.540
I was just joking.

11:57.000 --> 11:58.250
Shameless deed?

11:59.630 --> 12:01.590
Oh, it was a joke, huh?

12:01.840 --> 12:04.720
But, I should correct you on one thing...

12:04.800 --> 12:07.680
These aren't petals, they are wings.

12:07.720 --> 12:08.260
Wings?

12:08.520 --> 12:09.810
These are wings?

12:09.850 --> 12:10.350
Yes!

12:11.310 --> 12:12.980
Is that so?

12:15.060 --> 12:19.820
Oh yeah, speaking of my wings, let me tell you this story.

12:20.190 --> 12:24.160
When I was a model...

12:35.790 --> 12:36.840
Haru!

12:47.100 --> 12:49.390
What a lucky guy you are!

12:49.890 --> 12:53.600
But now I will have the pleasure of continuing!

12:54.600 --> 12:59.900
The pleasure of trying to kill each other with the same sword from Musica...

13:00.400 --> 13:02.190
What a joy this is!

13:02.580 --> 13:04.370
Same?!

13:06.110 --> 13:08.410
What same swords from Musica?

13:09.330 --> 13:12.000
You killed Musica's...

13:13.500 --> 13:17.130
That old man's family with this sword!

13:21.210 --> 13:23.970
Musica's family was killed?

13:26.220 --> 13:27.680
So what?

13:27.800 --> 13:29.720
I was just testing the sword out.

13:30.180 --> 13:32.180
I will never forgive you!

13:36.350 --> 13:37.400
Good.

13:57.120 --> 14:00.750
Come on, Rave Master!

14:26.820 --> 14:28.160
What is this?

14:28.200 --> 14:30.450
Lance is getting pushed back?!

14:30.570 --> 14:31.990
This can't be...

14:32.370 --> 14:34.950
Good! At this rate, he can win, right?

14:35.120 --> 14:37.250
No, if this continues, it's going to be bad.

14:38.210 --> 14:40.210
He's only going in by force.

14:41.210 --> 14:42.540
For a proof, look closely.

14:43.670 --> 14:45.800
Haru's attacks aren't hitting him...

14:54.260 --> 14:58.100
But many of his beasts are biting Haru.

14:59.890 --> 15:02.020
Oh no... Haru...

15:08.150 --> 15:12.160
What's wrong? Are you finished?!

15:17.160 --> 15:18.830
Explosion!

15:39.200 --> 15:40.380
Plue!

15:41.060 --> 15:42.940
Plue! When did you?!

15:45.980 --> 15:50.030
Plue, what are you doing?! It's dangerous. Move away!

15:51.820 --> 15:53.870
What were you thinking?!

15:54.320 --> 15:55.530
Don't you understand?

15:55.660 --> 15:57.490
He's telling you to calm down.

16:03.630 --> 16:05.040
Is that so?

16:08.170 --> 16:11.440
Thank you. It's ok now, Plue.

16:14.260 --> 16:16.220
That chihuahua and Haru

16:17.060 --> 16:18.640
make a good team together.

16:21.890 --> 16:24.600
What is this fucking creature?!

16:25.860 --> 16:27.570
We need to execute you right away.

16:27.600 --> 16:28.570
D-don't!

16:31.650 --> 16:34.490
Bite him to death!

16:34.990 --> 16:36.320
Plue!

16:43.870 --> 16:45.210
Shit!

16:48.000 --> 16:50.010
Ah! No!

16:53.130 --> 16:54.130
He got stuck.

16:55.590 --> 16:56.970
It's coming again.

16:57.010 --> 16:58.350
Plue can't run!

16:58.950 --> 17:00.100
Plue!

17:04.940 --> 17:06.980
It dodged! Plue!

17:11.900 --> 17:13.070
That was close.

17:13.400 --> 17:15.240
Why did it disappear without even biting him?!

17:16.570 --> 17:19.830
That's fine. Such a thing is not even worth killing.

17:22.830 --> 17:25.920
I know now! I know your Dark Bring's weak point!

17:26.620 --> 17:27.670
Say what?

17:27.960 --> 17:29.960
You can only make the illusion real...

17:34.720 --> 17:36.320
The moment it bites!

17:36.760 --> 17:41.180
I see. That's why he called it the real moment.

17:43.730 --> 17:47.440
That's the weak point? Don't make me laugh.

17:47.770 --> 17:50.000
Reality for one moment is enough.

17:50.030 --> 17:52.220
As long as it can bite, I have the advantage.

17:52.610 --> 17:56.650
If I can shift my timing to right before it bites, I will win!

17:56.910 --> 17:57.660
Then...

17:59.910 --> 18:06.080
Try to break this, my Dark Bring's real moment!

18:08.000 --> 18:09.290
What?! So many?!

18:10.750 --> 18:13.960
With this many, it will be impossible to beat them all.

18:14.130 --> 18:17.880
Now go, Beast Fangs!

18:18.550 --> 18:19.970
Not so fast!

18:23.600 --> 18:23.900
Whoa!

18:24.520 --> 18:26.980
In spite of all those beasts, he's charging in.

18:27.020 --> 18:28.980
What the hell is that kid thinking?

18:30.580 --> 18:32.150
Explosion!

18:33.730 --> 18:34.730
Smoke!

18:38.360 --> 18:40.450
I see. That was to blind him.

18:40.740 --> 18:43.200
With this smoke, he won't be able to attack Haru

18:43.330 --> 18:46.040
and when he tries to make his beasts attack, the timing will be off.

18:46.250 --> 18:48.790
Although I don't quite get it, it's awesome!

18:57.840 --> 18:58.550
What?!

18:59.840 --> 19:03.180
Wh-wh... Why didn't it...

19:03.810 --> 19:05.850
...blind him?!

19:19.200 --> 19:23.830
Didn't you know that animals have a better
sense of smell than sight?

19:24.030 --> 19:27.000
Because of your scent they knew where you were!

19:29.210 --> 19:30.330
Shit!

19:33.500 --> 19:36.710
It's over now! Die!

19:48.610 --> 19:49.540
Musica!

19:51.190 --> 19:54.230
Damn you... Old man... Where did you come from?

19:54.650 --> 19:55.660
Let go!

19:56.730 --> 20:00.860
From a mere punk, you've turned into
someone powerful, huh, Lance?

20:05.330 --> 20:07.740
Musica, why did you come?

20:09.410 --> 20:14.250
I forgot about his Dark Bring's real moment.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.750
This is my contribution for forgetting to tell you that earlier.

20:17.670 --> 20:19.630
Let me do this.

20:19.760 --> 20:23.720
No! I said to leave him to me!

20:25.600 --> 20:26.980
No, I can't let you.

20:27.010 --> 20:33.690
Explosion is a strong sword, but because
of that, the damage you take is huge.

20:34.810 --> 20:37.860
With those wounds, you can afford only one more attack.

20:38.190 --> 20:40.110
You'll break yourself if you attack more than once.

20:41.360 --> 20:46.240
If you fight sword to sword, without a doubt, Lance will win.

20:46.530 --> 20:49.910
So, while I'm holding onto him, finish him!

20:51.580 --> 20:54.420
Annoying old man! I'm going kill you.

20:55.710 --> 20:59.920
Even if I perish, I will not let go!

21:00.010 --> 21:03.010
Then I'll have to cut your arms off!

21:11.060 --> 21:13.980
Damn you... Where did you get that chain from?

21:15.140 --> 21:16.030
Plue!

21:17.520 --> 21:18.770
The little guy...

21:19.690 --> 21:22.280
Haru! Now is your only chance!

21:22.490 --> 21:24.110
Finish Lance now!

21:26.740 --> 21:28.450
Then let go of him.

21:28.910 --> 21:30.280
Otherwise this is going hit you.

21:32.870 --> 21:35.290
Who said I didn't want to be hit?

21:37.670 --> 21:39.790
Pierce through my body!

21:46.630 --> 21:47.890
Wha... What?!

21:48.300 --> 21:49.220
No way.

21:51.010 --> 21:53.020
Pierce through?

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're wings on my heart kono negai haruka na yume no shijima ni tokete

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.

23:44.020 --> 23:45.300
What is it, Plue?

23:45.340 --> 23:47.500
Next week Plue is going to be awesome,

23:47.530 --> 23:49.650
so he is saying, "please don't miss it".

23:49.690 --> 23:51.510
Plue is? Really?

23:52.610 --> 23:54.890
What on earth is it this time, old man?!

23:54.930 --> 23:57.850
He's saying, "I'm also going to be awesome,
so please watch it".

23:58.170 --> 23:59.490
Then say it by yourselves!

23:59.520 --> 24:00.610
On the next episode of Rave

24:00.650 --> 24:03.000
Finale! The Explosion Sword's victory!

24:03.060 --> 24:04.530
Don't die, old man!
